OpenJDK Runtime Environment (build 10.0.1-adoptopenjdk+0-adhoc.jenkins.openjdk) Eclipse OpenJ9 VM (build master-25d93508, JRE 10 Linux amd64-64-Bit Compressed References 20180518_54 (JIT enabled, AOT enabled)
