 /home/jenkins/workspace/Build-JDK8-linux_x86-64_cmprssptrs/jdk/src/share/native/java/nio/Bits.c:33: undefined reference to `JVM_CopySwapMemory'
The previous build had the following natives which were merged into `Java_java_nio_Bits_copySwapMemory0;`
Java_java_nio_Bits_copyFromShortArray;
Java_java_nio_Bits_copyToShortArray;
Java_java_nio_Bits_copyFromIntArray;
