Summary of problem
I have an application that connects to a remove JVM using JDI. The remove JVM is running OpenJ9. As part of invoking a method with a varargs signature, JDI calls VisibleClasses on the class loader of the declaring type of the method. The result is:
com.sun.jdi.ClassNotLoadedException: Class java.lang.Object[] not loaded
