The class loader is `jdk.internal.loader.ClassLoaders$PlatformClassLoader`.
This error does not happen with a "regular" OpenJDK JVM, so it appears it has to do with OpenJ9. Visible classes in a OpenJDK 11 (non-OpenJ9) include for example:
