OpenJDK Runtime Environment AdoptOpenJDK (build 15+36)
Eclipse OpenJ9 VM AdoptOpenJDK (build openj9-0.22.0, JRE 15 Windows 10 amd64-64-Bit Compressed References 20200922_45 (JIT enabled, AOT enabled)
OpenJ9 - 1830b1927
OMR - 73d5e7623
JCL - 7e7613c015 based on jdk-15+36)
Hello World
