Exception in thread "main" java/lang/NullPointerException
 at java/lang/ClassLoader.findNative (java.base@9/ClassLoader.java:1828)
 at java/lang/Thread.setNameImpl (java.base@9/Thread.java:4294967295)
 at java/lang/Thread.<init> (java.base@9/Thread.java:145)
Version output of that version:
