description:
Class modifiers `ACC_IDENTITY`, `ACC_VALUE` and `ACC_PRIMITIVE` are added in project Valhalla. `Class.getModifiers()` should return:
1. `ACC_IDENTITY` for identity classes
2. `ACC_VALUE` for value classes
3. `ACC_VALUE | ACC_PRIMITIVE` for primitive value types
Currently these flags are missing in the return value of `Class.getModifiers()` in OpenJ9 Implementation.
public value class ValueClassInt {
 int i;
 public ValueClassInt(int i) {
 this.i = i;
 }
 public static void main(String[] args) {
 System.out.println("Value Class modifiers are " + ValueClassInt.class.getModifiers());
 System.out.println("Primitive VT modifiers are " + ValueInt.class.getModifiers());
 System.out.println("Identity Class modifiers are " + System.class.getModifiers());
 }
}
primitive class ValueInt {
 int i;
 public ValueInt(int i) {
 this.i = i;
 }
}
OpenJ9 output:
Value Class modifiers are 17
Primitive VT modifiers are 16
Identity Class modifiers are 17
RI output:
Value Class modifiers are 81
Primitive VT modifiers are 2128
Identity Class modifiers are 49

