This error means that successive openings don't operate correctly - which makes other things hard.
I asked on Slack (et al) and ... I guess this is a `generic issue?`
I've attached a standalone example of this happening on Windows.
One of the last lines `jvm->DestroyJavaVM();` returns `JVM_ERR (-1)` after which point the `JNI_CreateJavaVM` calls stop working.
/*
Simple test demonstrating that the OpenJ9 JVM doesn't close/re-open on Windows
